            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Ugh, we brought too little money...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10131307"
            ]
          },
          "10131307": {
            "id": "10131307",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Toe",
            "text": "This is all you've got? Then no can do.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10131308"
            ]
          },
          "10131308": {
            "id": "10131308",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Please go look for someone named Childe...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10131309"
            ]
          },
          "10131309": {
            "id": "10131309",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Toe",
            "text": "Childe? No, no, no. He's putting up the money? Still, no. Wouldn't that mean that I have to make two trips rather than one?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10131310"
            ]
          },
          "10131310": {
            "id": "10131310",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Toe",
            "text": "How about this. Let's make a trade. I'll take what you're offering right now, and...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10131311"
            ]
          },
          "10131311": {
            "id": "10131311",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Toe",
            "text": "Get me a piece of <color=#00E1FFFF>iron ore</color>. I'll take that as payment to go see that Childe person. What do you think?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10131312"
            ]
          },
          "10131312": {
            "id": "10131312",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Guess we've got no choice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "101314",
      "subQuestName": "Give the Iron Chunk to Toe",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10137901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10137901": {
            "id": "10137901",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Toe",
            "text": "Have you brought the goods?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10137902"
            ]
          },
          "10137902": {
            "id": "10137902",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Toe",
            "text": "Mm, this is good ore. As an adventurer, one must have a trusty weapon by one's side...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10137903"
            ]
          },
          "10137903": {
            "id": "10137903",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Toe",
            "text": "This'll work. Once I've finished, I will go and claim my payment."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "101317",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10131701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10131701": {
            "id": "10131701",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "All finished then? Splendid. Any leftover cash is yours to keep — a favor for the Fatui should never go unrewarded.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10131702"
            ]
          },
          "10131702": {
            "id": "10131702",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You think you can buy us off with some loose change? No way! Paimon demands to know when the next payment is coming!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10131703"
            ]
          },
          "10131703": {
            "id": "10131703",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Haha. Well, how does this sound: You give me the information I need, and maybe I'll leave the Northland Bank's vaults open and unattended for half an hour...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10131704"
            ]
          },
          "10131704": {
            "id": "10131704",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What info do you need!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10131705"
            ]
          },
          "10131705": {
            "id": "10131705",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "No!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10131706"
            ]
          },
          "10131706": {
            "id": "10131706",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Huh? {NICKNAME}, does that mean you know what he's after?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10131709"
            ]
          },
          "10131709": {
            "id": "10131709",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yikes! You're right, Signora...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10131710"
            ]
          },
          "10131710": {
            "id": "10131710",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10131711"
            ]
          },
          "10131711": {
            "id": "10131711",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "#You both need to calm down... I don't know what's gotten into you, {NICKNAME}.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10131712"
            ]
          },
          "10131712": {
            "id": "10131712",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Just what is this about? The atmosphere got so tense all of a sudden.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10131713"
            ]
          },
          "10131713": {
            "id": "10131713",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ehh...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10131714"
            ]
          },
          "10131714": {
            "id": "10131714",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Next, we need some Everlasting Incense. For this, we need to go to Bubu Pharmacy, the finest pharmacy in all of—",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10131715"
            ]
          },
          "10131715": {
            "id": "10131715",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Is... everything okay?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10131716"
            ]
          },
          "10131716": {
            "id": "10131716",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Everything is fine. I was just informing them that they need not return the surplus Mora.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10131717"
            ]
          },
          "10131717": {
            "id": "10131717",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Now, if you'll excuse me, I must be going."
          }
        }
      }
    },
